<br><HTML>Hi All,<br>
<br>
As most of you know I recently moved cross country and was away a couple weeks.  Since getting settled and trying to get back into EQ, I have discovered that some of the recent patches have made that impossible.<p>
<br>
I am totally unable to log in without going LD within 5 minutes, most of the time I can't even log in at all, it will come to the server screen and as soon as I pick one, any one, EQ shuts down.<p>
<br>
I have spoken to GM's, Guides, and their tech support staff and have done everything they tell me to try and have tried some other stuff on my own, all to no avail, I have tried everything short of buying a new system, which I am not about to do just because they had to mess with the code to support things that aren't even here yet.<p>
<br>
So in short if they don't have "their" problem with the game fixed by the end of this week, I will be closing my account, I am not going to pay for something I can't use.  I will post again come weeks end and let you know where things stand.<p>
<br>
Farewell for now<br>
Keiden/Nerien</HTML></font></tt><p>
