<br><HTML>Do not dispair mate, surely with the vast knowledge the guild can draw on we can remedy yer situation, ye have tryed the tried and true method of uninstalling completely and reinstalling from scratch I assume:P.<br>
<br>
I had a problem that sounds similar, when it went from loggin screen with the pasty elf girl, the screen would just be black. I fixed it by releasing me ip config and relogging, If me memory from school so long ago serves me right ye would go to dos prompt and type in winipcnf /releaseall....do a dir on the win to see if winipcnf is right, then when it releases it, just log in.<br>
<br>
Does it get to the character screen or just to server screen? if gets to char screen does it happen to all yer char? <br>
<br>
It really sounds a bit like a routing problem, did you change ISP's?<br>
<br>
Another thing Ive had problems with in the past is Im forced to use bell south for phone lines, and they are noisy, so if you use a crummy ISP like AOL who doesnt use very good equipment to filter noise, it has bad lag and disconects alot, why I got rid of AOL, besides the fact they charge 5 times what others charge for little more really:)<br>
<br>
But enough complaining, anyone else got any ideas? Ill post any I think off or find from asking around.<br>
<br>
P.S. dont bother asking guides or GM's they mostly parrot basic lines like IT MUST BE YOUR ISP:P<br>
<br>
